<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="403710535"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1700472669"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Reverie"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Dana Salah"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ashes"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:59.657"><div begin="00:23.312" end="03:19.555"><p begin="00:23.312" end="00:25.251" itunes:key="L1">When you're screaming out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你喊得足够大声</span></p><p begin="00:26.134" end="00:27.656" itunes:key="L2">But you can't make a sound<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却依旧一片寂静时</span></p><p begin="00:27.695" end="00:29.023" itunes:key="L3">You know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么</span></p><p begin="00:30.513" end="00:32.781" itunes:key="L4">It's only a dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那只是一个梦而已</span></p><p begin="00:34.353" end="00:36.401" itunes:key="L5">When your back hits the ground<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你摔倒在地</span></p><p begin="00:37.390" end="00:38.687" itunes:key="L6">And things turn around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发现一切都变得不一样时</span></p><p begin="00:38.736" end="00:40.187" itunes:key="L7">You know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么</span></p><p begin="00:41.286" end="00:43.450" itunes:key="L8">It was only a dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那只是梦一场</span></p><p begin="00:44.272" end="00:46.778" itunes:key="L9">'Cause nothing is as bad as you think<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为一切都没你想的那么糟</span></p><p begin="00:46.903" end="00:49.394" itunes:key="L10">Even when you're pulling at the seams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算你在崩溃边缘</span></p><p begin="00:49.524" end="00:52.228" itunes:key="L11">When the lights go out, you still got me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便世界一片黑暗 我也会在你身边</span></p><p begin="00:55.396" end="00:57.728" itunes:key="L12">Detours lead to barricades<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生充满弯路 坎坷不已</span></p><p begin="00:57.922" end="01:00.359" itunes:key="L13">And home is far, your friends are fake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算离家再远 身边的朋友再虚伪</span></p><p begin="01:00.855" end="01:03.185" itunes:key="L14">I'll be there to clear the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会为你扫清一切不顺</span></p><p begin="01:06.053" end="01:10.658" itunes:key="L15">And you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你</span></p><p begin="01:11.552" end="01:13.784" itunes:key="L16">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能保护好你</span></p><p begin="01:14.191" end="01:16.501" itunes:key="L17">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能照顾好你 让你安下心来</span></p><p begin="01:17.078" end="01:22.132" itunes:key="L18">And you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你</span></p><p begin="01:22.543" end="01:24.701" itunes:key="L19">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能保护好你</span></p><p begin="01:25.232" end="01:27.597" itunes:key="L20">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能照顾好你 让你安下心来</span></p><p begin="02:13.642" end="02:15.567" itunes:key="L21">When the roof caves in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就当一切分崩离析</span></p><p begin="02:16.372" end="02:17.935" itunes:key="L22">And you just can't win<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你却无能为力时</span></p><p begin="02:17.982" end="02:19.556" itunes:key="L23">You know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么</span></p><p begin="02:20.603" end="02:24.359" itunes:key="L24">It'll only get better, only get better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事情只会慢慢变好</span></p><p begin="02:24.779" end="02:26.680" itunes:key="L25">When you fall too far<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你跌得太痛</span></p><p begin="02:27.453" end="02:28.909" itunes:key="L26">Can't go back to the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法重新开始</span></p><p begin="02:28.928" end="02:30.500" itunes:key="L27">You know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么</span></p><p begin="02:31.643" end="02:34.727" itunes:key="L28">It'll only get better, only get better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事情只会慢慢变好</span></p><p begin="02:34.785" end="02:37.087" itunes:key="L29">Nothing is as bad as you think<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都没你想得那么糟</span></p><p begin="02:37.279" end="02:39.834" itunes:key="L30">Even when you're pulling at the seams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算你在崩溃边缘</span></p><p begin="02:39.889" end="02:42.697" itunes:key="L31">When the lights go out, you still got me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便世界一片黑暗 我也会在你身边</span></p><p begin="02:45.916" end="02:48.041" itunes:key="L32">Detours lead to barricades<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人生充满弯路 坎坷不已</span></p><p begin="02:48.222" end="02:50.949" itunes:key="L33">And home is far, your friends are fake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算离家再远 身边的朋友再虚伪</span></p><p begin="02:51.247" end="02:53.777" itunes:key="L34">I'll be there to clear the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会为你扫清一切不顺</span></p><p begin="02:56.476" end="03:01.084" itunes:key="L35">And you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你</span></p><p begin="03:01.822" end="03:04.126" itunes:key="L36">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能保护好你</span></p><p begin="03:04.561" end="03:06.757" itunes:key="L37">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能照顾好你 让你安下心来</span></p><p begin="03:07.439" end="03:12.142" itunes:key="L38">And you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你</span></p><p begin="03:12.853" end="03:15.100" itunes:key="L39">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能保护好你</span></p><p begin="03:15.576" end="03:19.555" itunes:key="L40">You know my love can hold you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道么 我的爱能照顾好你 让你安下心来</span></p></div></body></tt>